msgstr "Authors' own records are transferred to the public domain; local copies have not been changed."

msgid ". Шкала старта: 0–2 → A1, 3–4 → A2, 5–6 → B1, 7–8 → B2. В базовой части:"
msgstr "Start scale: 0–2 → A1, 3–4 → A2, 5–6 → B1, 7–8 → B2."

msgid ". Шкала старта: 0–2 → A1, 3–4 → A2, 5–6 → B1, 7–8 → B2. В базовой части: "
msgstr "Start scale: 0–2 → A1, 3–4 → A2, 5–6 → B1, 7–8 → B2."

